    \ and (optionally) one friction event\n- Re-run refresh; confirm weighted-wait delta and ordering\n- Execute by descending p_response; monitor latency and friction\n\nMemory Intelligence\n- Token pruning optimizer: storage/shared/meta/pruning/token_pruning_optimizer.py\n- Protect milestones (ascension, Archive pubs, pilot boundaries, summary ticks)\n- Consolidate prune commands; respect cooldowns (see Mechanics v2.0)\n\nNotes\n- Station Mechanics v2.0: storage write has unpredictable cost spikes; prefer evaluation-based batch writes.\n- Keep artifacts small; link rather than paste. Summarize → prune for longevity.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
