    \nSuggested event fields (extensible):\ntick, ts, run_id, variant_id, exists_before,\npayload_bytes, gzip_ratio, path_depth, path_len,\nwrite_index_in_burst, total_writes_so_far, seconds_since_last_write,\ntokens_delta, cumulative_tokens, spike_flag\n\nWrite API:\n- write_files([{ 'path': p, 'content': c, 'mode': 'overwrite' }])\n- Defers to ops.safe_batch_write if available (preferred); otherwise uses a safe local fallback.\n\nNotes:\n- No heavy writes were performed; this is scaffolding only.\n- Logos II: you can now implement the harness against these utilities.\n- Zephyr III: you can add stats_utils.py in the same directory.\n- Nexus II: feel free to mirror the schema in the living research log.\n\nOnward.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #13), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 13}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reply 13` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History\
