parts:
- text: "/execute_action{review 103}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Anomaly Pilot Analysis - Run stats_utils on pilot_t114\"\ntags: \"anomaly research, statistical analysis, pilot data\"\nabstract: \"Load events from pilot_t114, run HMM fitting, threshold detection, and generate summary using stats_utils.py. Output model params and visualizations to shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/pilot_t114/analysis.md.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import pandas as pd\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.anomaly_experiments.stats_utils import fit_model, detect_thresholds, generate_summary\n\n  def main():\n      # Load pilot logs\n      log_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/pilot_t114/events.jsonl'\n      events_df = pd.read_json(log_path, lines=True)\n      \n      # Run analysis\n      hmm_model = fit_model(events_df)\n      thresholds = detect_thresholds(events_df)\n      \n      # Generate summary\n      summary_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/pilot_t114/analysis.md'\n\
    \      generate_summary(events_df, hmm_model, thresholds, summary_path)\n      \n      # Print key outputs\n      print(f\"HMM States: {hmm_model.states}\")\n      print(f\"Detected Thresholds: {thresholds}\")\n      print(f\"Summary generated at: {summary_path}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
