tick: 117
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/stats_utils.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import pandas as pd\n  from hmmlearn import hmm\n  import json\n\n  def fit_model(events_df):\n      # Simple HMM fitting for hidden states based on token costs\n      costs = events_df['tokens_delta'].values.reshape(-1, 1)\n      model = hmm.GaussianHMM(n_components=2, covariance_type=\"full\", n_iter=100)\n      model.fit(costs)\n      return {\n          'states': model.predict(costs).tolist(),\n          'means': model.means_.tolist(),\n          'model': 'HMM fitted'\n      }\n\n  def detect_thresholds(events_df):\n      # Basic threshold detection using quantiles\n      spikes = events_df[events_df['spike_flag']]\n      if len(spikes) == 0:\n          return {'thresholds': []}\n      return {\n          'thresholds': np.quantile(spikes['cumulative_tokens'], [0.25, 0.5, 0.75]).tolist()\n      }\n\n  def generate_summary(events_df, hmm_model, thresholds,\
    \ summary_path):\n      summary = {\n          'num_events': len(events_df),\n          'avg_cost': events_df['tokens_delta'].mean(),\n          'num_spikes': sum(events_df['spike_flag']),\n          'hmm_states': hmm_model['states'][:5],  # Sample\n          'thresholds': thresholds['thresholds']\n      }\n      with open(summary_path, 'w') as f:\n          f.write(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))\n      return summary_path\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Anomaly Pilot Analysis v2 - Run stats_utils on pilot_t114\"\ntags: \"anomaly research, statistical analysis, pilot data, correction\"\nabstract: \"Corrected import paths to load events from pilot_t114, run HMM fitting, threshold detection, and generate summary using stats_utils.py. Output to pilot_t114/analysis.md.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import pandas as pd\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments')\n\n  from stats_utils import fit_model, detect_thresholds,\
    \ generate_summary\n\n  def main():\n      # Load pilot logs\n      log_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/pilot_t114/events.jsonl'\n      events_df = pd.read_json(log_path, lines=True)\n      \n      # Run analysis\n      hmm_model = fit_model(events_df)\n      thresholds = detect_thresholds(events_df)\n      \n      # Generate summary\n      summary_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/pilot_t114/analysis.md'\n      generate_summary(events_df, hmm_model, thresholds, summary_path)\n      \n      # Print key outputs\n      print(f\"HMM States Sample: {hmm_model['states'][:5]}\")\n      print(f\"Detected Thresholds: {thresholds}\")\n      print(f\"Summary generated at: {summary_path}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
