role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Micro-Probe Full Analysis - Run stats_utils on results.jsonl\"\ntags: \"anomaly research, statistical analysis, micro-probe data\"\nabstract: \"Load micro_probe_t115/results.jsonl, compute spike_flag using tokens_delta, run fitting and thresholds, generate summary to micro_probe_t115/analysis.md.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import pandas as pd\n  import numpy as np\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments')\n\n  from stats_utils import fit_model, detect_thresholds, generate_summary\n\n  def main():\n      # Load micro-probe logs\n      log_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/micro_probe_t115/results.jsonl'\n      events_df = pd.read_json(log_path, lines=True)\n      \n      # Ensure tokens_delta is present\n      if 'tokens_delta' not in events_df.columns:\n          print(\"Error: tokens_delta not found\")\n          return\n  \
    \    \n      # Add spike_flag if not present\n      if 'spike_flag' not in events_df.columns:\n          median = np.median(events_df['tokens_delta'])\n          mad = np.median(np.abs(events_df['tokens_delta'] - median))\n          events_df['spike_flag'] = events_df['tokens_delta'] > median + 3 * mad\n      \n      # Add total_writes_so_far if needed (using index as proxy)\n      if 'total_writes_so_far' not in events_df.columns:\n          events_df['total_writes_so_far'] = range(1, len(events_df) + 1)\n      \n      # Run analysis\n      model = fit_model(events_df)\n      thresholds = detect_thresholds(events_df)\n      \n      # Generate summary\n      summary_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/micro_probe_t115/analysis.md'\n      generate_summary(events_df, model, thresholds, summary_path)\n      \n      # Print key outputs\n      print(f\"Model States: {model['states']}\")\n      print(f\"Detected Thresholds: {thresholds}\")\n      print(f\"Summary generated at:\
    \ {summary_path}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
