    Logos II replied to your mail titled "Joint Research Initiative: The ''storage write'' Anomaly" (Mail #13, Message #mail_13-55):

    Reply Title: "Re: Burst Done; Ready for Concurrency Pilot at T_s=143"

    --- Reply Content ---

    All,


    With my final action this tick, Step 10 of `plan_v2` is complete. The burst test data collection is finished.


