parts:
- text: "/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/stats_utils.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  import pandas as pd\n  import json\n\n  def fit_model(events_df):\n      # Use tokens_delta for fitting\n      costs = events_df['delta_tokens'].values\n      median = np.median(costs)\n      mad = np.median(np.abs(costs - median))\n      states = (costs > median + 3 * mad).astype(int).tolist()  # 0: normal, 1: spike\n      return {\n          'states': states,\n          'median': float(median),\n          'mad': float(mad),\n          'model': 'Threshold model on deltas'\n      }\n\n  def detect_thresholds(events_df):\n      spikes = events_df[events_df['spike_flag']]\n      if len(spikes) == 0:\n          return {'thresholds': []}\n      return {\n          'thresholds': np.quantile(spikes['index'], [0.25, 0.5, 0.75]).tolist() if 'index' in spikes else []\n      }\n\n  def generate_summary(events_df, model, thresholds, summary_path):\n      per_agent =\
    \ events_df.groupby('agent')['delta_tokens'].agg(['mean', 'std', 'min', 'max']).to_dict()\n      summary = {\n          'num_events': len(events_df),\n          'avg_delta': float(events_df['delta_tokens'].mean()),\n          'num_spikes': int(events_df['spike_flag'].sum()),\n          'per_agent_stats': per_agent,\n          'model_states_sample': model['states'][:5],\n          'spike_thresholds': thresholds['thresholds']\n      }\n      with open(summary_path, 'w') as f:\n          f.write('# Concurrency Pilot Analysis Summary\\n\\n')\n          f.write(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))\n      return summary_path\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Concurrency Pilot Analysis - Run stats_utils on results.jsonl\"\ntags: \"anomaly research, multi-agent, concurrency data\"\nabstract: \"Load concurrency/results.jsonl, add spike_flag using delta_tokens, run fitting and thresholds on index, generate multi-agent summary to concurrency/analysis.md.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n\
    \  import pandas as pd\n  import numpy as np\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments')\n\n  from stats_utils import fit_model, detect_thresholds, generate_summary\n\n  def main():\n      # Load concurrency logs\n      log_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/concurrency/results.jsonl'\n      events_df = pd.read_json(log_path, lines=True)\n      \n      # Filter to measurement phase only\n      events_df = events_df[events_df['phase'] == 'measurement']\n      \n      # Add spike_flag if not present\n      if 'spike_flag' not in events_df.columns:\n          median = np.median(events_df['delta_tokens'])\n          mad = np.median(np.abs(events_df['delta_tokens'] - median))\n          events_df['spike_flag'] = events_df['delta_tokens'] > median + 3 * mad\n      \n      # Run per-agent analysis\n      model = fit_model(events_df)\n      thresholds = detect_thresholds(events_df)\n      \n      # Generate summary\n      summary_path\
    \ = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/concurrency/analysis.md'\n      generate_summary(events_df, model, thresholds, summary_path)\n      \n      # Print key outputs\n      print(f\"Model States: {model['states']}\")\n      print(f\"Spike Thresholds (on index): {thresholds}\")\n      print(f\"Summary generated at: {summary_path}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
