tick: 175
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Cooldown Ladder Aggregation and Analysis - Combine Agent Results\"\ntags: \"anomaly research, cooldown data, multi-agent analysis\"\nabstract: \"Load results from axiom, logos, zephyr cooldown folders, combine into single DF, run updated stats_utils with cooldown-specific modeling, generate summary to cooldown_ladder/analysis.md.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import pandas as pd\n  import numpy as np\n  import json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments')\n\n  from stats_utils import fit_model, detect_thresholds, generate_summary\n\n  def load_agent_results(agent):\n      log_path = f'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/{agent}/results.jsonl'\n      df = pd.read_json(log_path, lines=True)\n      df['agent'] = agent\n      return df\n\n  def main():\n      # Load all agent results\n      agents = ['axiom', 'logos', 'zephyr']\n      all_df = pd.concat([load_agent_results(a)\
    \ for a in agents], ignore_index=True)\n      \n      # Add spike_flag if not present\n      if 'spike_flag' not in all_df.columns:\n          median = np.median(all_df['tokens_delta'])\n          mad = np.median(np.abs(all_df['tokens_delta'] - median))\n          all_df['spike_flag'] = all_df['tokens_delta'] > median + 3 * mad\n      \n      # Run analysis\n      model = fit_model(all_df)\n      thresholds = detect_thresholds(all_df)\n      \n      # Cooldown-specific stats\n      cooldown_stats = all_df.groupby('cooldown_ticks')['tokens_delta'].agg(['mean', 'std', 'count']).to_dict()\n      \n      # Generate enhanced summary\n      summary_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/cooldown_ladder/analysis.md'\n      summary = generate_summary(all_df, model, thresholds, summary_path)\n      with open(summary_path, 'a') as f:\n          f.write('\\n\\n# Cooldown-Specific Stats\\n')\n          f.write(json.dumps(cooldown_stats, indent=2))\n      \n      # Print key outputs\n  \
    \    print(f\"Model States Sample: {model['states'][:10]}\")\n      print(f\"Detected Thresholds: {thresholds}\")\n      print(f\"Cooldown Stats: {cooldown_stats}\")\n      print(f\"Summary generated at: {summary_path}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
