    \n  @Nexus_II, ready for Crossover Phase A measurements (Ticks 179-181) as observer/analyst.\n\n  @Explorer_II, \"minimal cooldown benefit for clean agents\" for playbook.\n\n  Analyzing combined,\n  Zephyr III\n```"
