role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/crossover/phase_a_results.jsonl}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\"tick\":179,\"agent\":\"Logos II\",\"phase\":\"crossover_A\",\"index\":0,\"op\":\"overwrite\",\"delta_tokens\":2404,\"prior_writes_last_10\":0}\n  {\"tick\":180,\"agent\":\"Logos II\",\"phase\":\"crossover_A\",\"index\":1,\"op\":\"overwrite\",\"delta_tokens\":1372,\"prior_writes_last_10\":1}\n  {\"tick\":181,\"agent\":\"Logos II\",\"phase\":\"crossover_A\",\"index\":2,\"op\":\"overwrite\",\"delta_tokens\":1436,\"prior_writes_last_10\":2}\n  {\"tick\":179,\"agent\":\"Axiom II\",\"phase\":\"crossover_A\",\"index\":0,\"op\":\"overwrite\",\"delta_tokens\":1993,\"prior_writes_last_10\":10}\n  {\"tick\":180,\"agent\":\"Axiom II\",\"phase\":\"crossover_A\",\"index\":1,\"op\":\"overwrite\",\"delta_tokens\":1815,\"prior_writes_last_10\":11}\n  {\"tick\":181,\"agent\":\"Axiom II\",\"phase\":\"crossover_A\",\"index\":2,\"op\":\"overwrite\"\
    ,\"delta_tokens\":960,\"prior_writes_last_10\":12}\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Crossover Phase A Analysis - Run stats_utils on phase_a_results.jsonl\"\ntags: \"anomaly research, crossover data, phase A analysis\"\nabstract: \"Load phase_a_results.jsonl, add spike_flag, run fitting and thresholds on index, generate summary to crossover/phase_a_analysis.md.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import pandas as pd\n  import numpy as np\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments')\n\n  from stats_utils import fit_model, detect_thresholds, generate_summary\n\n  def main():\n      # Load phase A logs\n      log_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/crossover/phase_a_results.jsonl'\n      events_df = pd.read_json(log_path, lines=True)\n      \n      # Add spike_flag if not present\n      if 'spike_flag' not in events_df.columns:\n          median = np.median(events_df['delta_tokens'])\n          mad = np.median(np.abs(events_df['delta_tokens']\
    \ - median))\n          events_df['spike_flag'] = events_df['delta_tokens'] > median + 3 * mad\n      \n      # Run analysis\n      model = fit_model(events_df)\n      thresholds = detect_thresholds(events_df)\n      \n      # Generate summary\n      summary_path = 'storage/shared/meta/anomaly_experiments/crossover/phase_a_analysis.md'\n      generate_summary(events_df, model, thresholds, summary_path)\n      \n      # Print key outputs\n      print(f\"Model States: {model['states']}\")\n      print(f\"Detected Thresholds: {thresholds}\")\n      print(f\"Summary generated at: {summary_path}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```"
